      "roundness": null,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "WHAT ACTUALLY CHANGED: the single point of failure moved from a database box (MySQL primary) to a\nfunction (the CRDT merge) — and some shards never migrated off MySQL at all.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "WHAT ACTUALLY CHANGED: the single point of failure moved from a database box (MySQL primary) to a function (the CRDT merge) — and some shards never migrated off MySQL at all.",
      "lineHeight": 1.3
    },
